	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Divina factum esse providentia mihi persuadeo, doctissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quod inertiae suae vesaniam admirabili quadam impudentia rursum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>orbi testatam facere <placeName ref="l1322">Lovanienses</placeName> illi magistri voluerunt, a quibus d<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>amna<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tum esse me tantum abest ut doleam, ut mihi etiam gratuler hoc ipso, quod me in <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tam illustri damnatorum coetu numerare sunt dignati.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Video enim, ab iis <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nonnisi pientissimos veterisque ecclesiasticae et apostolicae doctrinę per<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>itissimos viros inque his ipsis veteres et orthodoxos doctores omnes, immo <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>etiam Christum ipsum et eius apostolos haereseos damnari et se suosque <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>tot modis barbaros socordesque et extremae audacię rabulas pro suo <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>iure moreque in sua illa nuper nata et tam lepide exornata ecclesia ca<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>tholicos orthodoxosque censeri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quid opus erit <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentino</placeName> concilio, si tanti <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>a Caesare aestimatur <placeName ref="l1322">Lovanię</placeName> Sorbona, ut lynceis oculis inspicere <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>veritatem et de ea seorsim, non ullis consultis tot regnorum et provincia<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>rum ecclesiis, pronuntiare et partem damnare possit, quae, quibus de caus<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>sis digna sit damnatione, ne iota quidem unico docetur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Caesar <placeName ref="l18">Augu<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>stae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>liberam pollicetur et aequanimem de doctrina fidei cognitionem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nec damnandus censet quenquam, antequam audiatur; <placeName ref="l1322">Lovania</placeName> damnat <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et proscribit omnes illos, qui vernaculae suae religioni quadamtenus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>adversentur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quis non videat, istas Pallades de uno cerebro terreni Iovis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>nasci non posse, sed turbam pontificiam vere belluam esse multorum capi<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>tum, quae suarum tamen artium perfidiam summi monarchę nomine et auctorita<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>te fucant et ostentant neque aliud conantur magis, quam ut se ipsos <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>indignos faciant fide, quicquid tandem orbi polliceantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Facile igitur <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>erit nobis, horum concilia respuere et nosmet ipsos rebus magis <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>secundis servare, donec videamus, Carolum et nominis et officii <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>sui gloriae consulturum in hoc totum esse, ut de veritate scripturarum <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>perquirenda quam circumspectissime deliberetur, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et tandem videat, nec divinam nec naturalem aequitatem <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ferre posse, ut ullam de proferenda sententia facultatem sibi <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>assciscant aut arrogent, quos reos hac quidem in controversia <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>religionis totus orbis agit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Wir muͤssend sechen, wo sich alle untreuw hinlenken welle, und <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>muͤssend all anhalten, damit wir in der eydgnoschaft gantz <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>und gar khain mittel dissen knabatzen zuͦlaßind, durch welche ain <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>loblich gmainsame unser aller harbrachten freyhait möchte ay<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>nigs wegs getrendt und in abfall bracht werden.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">Laß man sy <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>sich mit ainandern erbalgen und versech man sich, das man <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>nach fruͤ gnuͦg zuͦ der sach khommen werd.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Wir wellend aber <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>losen.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Si quid accepero, mature tibi significabo.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z16"/><placeName ref="l303">Magdenbrug</placeName> habend sy das <placeName ref="l1322">lovanisch</placeName> edict verteutscht und <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>in dem truk außgon laßen; wirt bald harkhommen.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">M. <persName ref="p1214">Hans <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>Frieß</persName> ist eylendtz verritten; ist nie zuͦ mir khomen.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Hat mich ett<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>was bedurt; acht aber wol, er hab eß böser maynung nit thuͦn.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z20"/>Quae misisti, remitto et gratiam habeo insigni tuae fidei.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/><placeName ref="l473">S. Galli</placeName>, 28. septembris, anno 1550.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8049">Ioachimus Vadianus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Clariss<lb xml:id="p2z22"/>imo ornatissimoque viro domino <persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bullin<lb xml:id="p2z23"/>gero</persName>, ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> episcopo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>suo valde colendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>